QuestGuidance.Register("es",401,{
[12801]="700494B8\n1\tTalk to Párgrub\tYou should talk to Párgrub.\n2\tTalk to Párgrub\tPárgrub can be found near Thorzhaf. You should speak with Párgrub about the match.\n",
[12802]="700494B4\n1\tTalk to Párgrub\tYou should talk to Párgrub.\n2\tTalk to Párgrub\tPárgrub can be found near Thorzhaf. You should speak with Párgrub about the match.\n",
[12803]="700190F6\n1\tHabla con Hasta\tHasta se encuentra en la Bodega Putrefacta, en las Obras Hidráulicas de Moria. Debes hablar con Hasta para descubrir qué necesitará para preparar un señuelo destinado a la criatura que hay detrás de los inquietantes rumores.\n",
[12804]="70071615\n1\tVolver a Ahâba\tYou have secured an alliance with the former thralls of Esh Mêkag and the Servants of Aradûn. You should return to Mizâdi in Ahâba.\n2\tComplete 'Instance: The Plan of Attack'\tMizâdi is ready to plan the attack of Emax Dûl with her assembled allies. You should talk to Mizâdi and complete 'Instance: The Plan of Attack'.\n3\tTalk to Mizâdi\tYou have fended off an attack on Ahâba and have, perhaps, met a new key ally. You should talk to Mizâdi.\n",
[12805]="700571B6\n1\tTalk to Vaskorn in Limlók\tVaskorn can be found at Limlók in the Floodfells. You should talk to Vaskorn.\n2\tTalk to Runerik Knotbeard in Limlók\tRunerik Knotbeard can be found in Limlók. You should talk to Runerik Knotbeard.\n",
[12806]="70053E6E\n1\tRetrieve the urn from Shakam Moz\tThe urn Rauniel seeks can be found at Shakam Moz in the hills of eastern Rath Dúath. You should retrieve the urn for Rauniel.\n2\tPour water into a vessel upon the bridge to Eithel Gwaur\tThe final vessel can be found upon the bridge to Eithel Gwaur in Rath Dúath. You should pour water into the vessel for Rauniel.\n3\tTalk to Rauniel upon the bridge to Eithel Gwaur\tRauniel can be found upon the bridge to Eithel Gwaur in Rath Dúath. You should talk to Rauniel.\n",
[12807]="7004DA37\n1\tCure poisoned birds (total: 2)\030Cure poisoned frogs (total: 2)\030Cure poisoned rabbits (total: 3)\030Cure poisoned squirrels (total: 3)\030Cure poisoned foxes (total: 2)\tPoisoned animals can be found north of the path in Eryn Lasgalen. You should cure animals poisoned by the Taurogrim.\n2\tCompletado\tCompletado.\n",
[12808]="7007177F\n1\tTalk to the guard\tFaeron suggested talking to these people to learn more about them. You should talk to the guard at Gadim-ûn, a place in north-eastern An Shêru.\n2\tTalk to Nabatínu\tThe guard has directed you to speak with his leader, Nabatínu, inside Gadim-ûn, a place in north-eastern An Shêru.\n3\tHabla con Faeron\tNabatínu, who leads the people inside Gadim-ûn, a place in north-eastern An Shêru, has identified himself as an enemy of Ordâkh, and recommends against going any further west into An Shêru. You should talk to Faeron about what Nabatínu has said.\n4\tTalk to Nabatínu\tFaeron has asked Nabatínu, leader of the people inside Gadim-ûn in north-eastern An Shêru, if he knows of any areas of blight in An Shêru. You should talk to Nabatínu to hear his answer.\n5\tHabla con Faeron\tNabatínu has told you that he and the others here were once thralls of the Ordâkhai and have now found their freedom. They work to free the others still bound in thralldom. You should discuss the situation with Faeron.\n6\tTalk to Rhadrog at his camp\tFaeron has offered to assist the Jatsakóri and will meet you back at the Rangers' camp south of Gadim-ûn. You should go to the Ranger camp and talk to Rhadrog.\n",
[12809]="7000001B\n1\tHabla con Wilcome Tunnelly\tWilcome Tunelero está en Scary, al este de Tejonera. La posada El Arado y las Estrellas está en Tejonera, al oeste de Scary. Halson Fondocuba, de El Arado y las Estrellas, te ha enviado a Scary para buscar un envío de yeso que se ha extraviado.\n2\tLleva el yeso a Halson Fondocuba\030Recoge el yeso en polvo\tLos trasgos que robaron la carreta que transportaba el yeso venían de los Valles Rasgados, al norte de Tejonera. Parece que los trasgos se han apoderado del yeso destinado a El Arado y las Estrellas. Deberías viajar a su campamento y buscar la carreta perdida.\n",
[12810]="700033DB\n1\tLleva las cajas de tesoro a Áskell\030Recoge cajas de tesoro (total: 6)\tLas cajas de tesoro se encuentran en el puerto fluvial de Kheledûl, al este de Gondamon. Áskell ha ideado un nuevo plan para castigar a los Duramano por la muerte de Gellir. Te Ha pedido que asaltes la ciudad portuaria de Kheledûl y recuperes las cajas de tesoro robadas a los barbiluengos por los Duramano.\n",
[12811]="70066770\n1\tDefeat Corsairs of Umbar in Tarlang's Crown (0/14) Defeat Gondorian freebooters (0/6)\tCorsairs and Gondorian freebooters can be found at Azruthor's Rue and throughout Tarlang's Crown. While exploring the ruined remains of Azruthor's encampment in Tarlang's Crown, you have encountered a number of Gondorian freebooters and Corsairs of Umbar. You should defeat them and make safe the road through Tarlang's Crown.\n2\tDefeat Corsairs of Umbar in Tarlang's Crown (total: 14)\030Defeat Gondorian freebooters (total: 6)\tCorsairs and Gondorian freebooters can be found at Azruthor's Rue and throughout Tarlang's Crown. While exploring the ruined remains of Azruthor's encampment in Tarlang's Crown, you have encountered a number of Gondorian freebooters and Corsairs of Umbar. You should defeat them and make safe the road through Tarlang's Crown.\n3\tCompletado\tYou have defeated many Corsairs of Umbar and Gondorian freebooters in Tarlang's Crown.\n",
[12812]="7002CA8C\n1\tHabla con Idmar\tIdmar está en su campamento junto al camino, en el centro de Parth Celebrant. Debes llevarle los objetos a Idmar.\n2\tHabla con Doron\tDoron está entre sus hombres, en la cresta de la colina del oeste de Parth Celebrant. Idmar quiere que hables con Doron acerca de El Oriental.\n",
[12813]="70043025\n1\tFeed Spearflower to one of the goats in Imloth Melui\tThe goats can be found north-east of the Hall of the Gentle Hand, at the bottom of the long stairs. Brunil has asked you to feed each ingredient in the healing draught to a goat, one after another.\n2\tFeed Dusk-flower to one of the goats in Imloth Melui\tThe goats can be found north-east of the Hall of the Gentle Hand, at the bottom of the long stairs. Brunil has asked you to feed each ingredient in the healing draught to a goat, one after another.\n3\tFeed Maresfoot to one of the goats in Imloth Melui\tThe goats can be found north-east of the Hall of the Gentle Hand, at the bottom of the long stairs. Brunil has asked you to feed each ingredient in the healing draught to a goat, one after another.\n4\tTalk to Brunil in the Hall of the Gentle Hand\tBrunil can be found in the Hall of the Gentle Hand, on the western side of Imloth Melui. You fed all the ingredients in the draught to the goats, and the Maresfoot seemed to be disagreeable. You should return to Brunil with what you have learned.\n",
[12814]="70043026\n1\tCollect Dewleaf south-west of Imloth Melui (total: 6)\tDewleaf can be found on the bluff above River Erui, south-west of the entrance to Imloth Melui. Brunil has asked you to fetch as much Dewleaf as you can in order to counteract the poison her patients consumed.\n2\tReturn to Brunil in the Hall of the Gentle Hand\tBrunil can be found in the Hall of the Gentle Hand, on the western side of Imloth Melui. You have collected as much Dewleaf as you could find, and should bring it to Brunil.\n3\tAdd the Dewleaf to the cure at the healer's workbench in the Hall of the Gentle Hand\tThe healer's workbench is right by Brunil in the Hall of the Gentle Hand. It is where she makes all of her medicines. Brunil has prepared the cure, and it will be complete once you add the Dewleaf. The cure waits for you on the healer's workbench.\n4\tThe poisoned patients can be found throughout the Hall of the Gentle Hand in Imloth Melui. You should administer the compounded cure to the patients who drank the poison.\t\n5\tTalk to Brunil in the Hall of the Gentle Hand\tBrunil can be found in the Hall of the Gentle Hand, in Imloth Melui. You should tell Brunil that the cure has been administered to all the poisoned patients.\n6\tTalk to Merenir in the Hall of the Gentle Hand\tMerenir has come to the Hall of the Gentle Hand with a troubling report.\n",
[12815]="700479DE\n1\tEnter the enemy encampment of Dûm Boha\tThe Haradrim encampment of Dûm Boha is located on the western slopes of the Slag-hills. You should collect phials of poison from Haradrim archers.\n2\tCollect phials of poison (total: 10)\tThe Haradrim encampment of Dûm Boha is located on the western slopes of the Slag-hills. You should collect phials of poison from Haradrim archers.\n3\tReturn to Gladhir\tYou should return to Gladhir, who can be found at Haerondir.\n",
[12816]="700107C5\n1\tAtrapa tantos peces como puedas en veinte minutos.\tEl estanque de pesca se encuentra al este de la granja de Andrath. Will Marjacierva te ha pedido que captures peces para el Festival del Lithe de los hobbits.\n",
[12817]="70065B68\n1\tCollect building materials (total: 8)\tHimril has asked you to travel to Arnach to the south and search for building materials.\n2\tTalk to Himril\tAll of these building materials should account for what is missing from Himril's records. You should return to Himril. Himril is in Imloth Melui.\n",
[12818]="7002731F\n1\tEncuentra y desafía a Yevan, Olwen o Wundod\tYevan, Olwen y Wundod se pueden encontrar en Tûr Morva. Mair te ha desafiado a derrotar a uno de los jóvenes luchadores del Clan del Halcón en combate.\n2\tHabla con Mair en Tûr Morva\tMair se encuentra cerca de una gran roca, en la mitad norte del pueblo de Tûr Morva, en Tâl Methedras. Has derrotado fácilmente a un joven luchador del Clan del Halcón y deberías regresar con Mair.\n3\tEncuentra y desafía a Sors, Eiviona o Owein\tSors, Eiviona y Owein se pueden encontrar en algún lugar de Tûr Morva. Mair te ha desafiado a derrotar a uno de los luchadores más experimentados del Clan del Halcón en Tûr Morva.\n4\tHabla con Mair en Tûr Morva\tMair se encuentra cerca de una gran roca, en la mitad norte del pueblo de Tûr Morva, en Tâl Methedras. Has derrotado a un luchador experimentado del Clan del Halcón y deberías regresar con Mair.\n",
[12819]="7002C6F5\n1\tDerrota a los forajidos de Celebrant (total: 8)\030Derrota a los ladrones de reliquias de Celebrant (total: 4)\030Derrota a los arqueros de Celebrant (total: 6)\tLos forajidos se han reunido al sur, dentro de un gran campamento conocido como Hordfierd. Doron te ha pedido que derrotes a muchos de los forajidos que han invadido Parth Celebrant.\n2\tHabla con Idmar\tIdmar está en su campamento junto al camino, en el centro de Parth Celebrant. Doron te ha enviado a hablar con Idmar, tras tu ataque contra los forajidos.\n",
[12820]="70054884\n1\tEstás destinado a servir mediante el trabajo al Señor Oscuro.\t\n2\tRompe los escombros caídos (total: 8)\tSe pueden encontrar escombros caídos por todas las mazmorras de Barad-dûr.\n",
[12821]="70053E6F\n1\tDefeat enemies outside Eithel Gwaur (total: 4)\030Reach the door to Eithel Gwaur\tEithel Gwaur can be found in eastern Rath Dúath. You should defeat enemies outside Eithel Gwaur.\n2\tRauniel remains trapped inside Eithel Gwaur. You should find Rauniel inside Eithel Gwaur and save her.\t\n3\tTalk to Arodor at Echad Uial\tArodor can be found at Echad Uial in Rath Dúath. You should talk to Arodor.\n",
[12822]="7006B773\n1\tTalk to Amâsu\tGirhâzi has asked you to speak to Amâsu about the prisoner.\n2\tFind where the prisoner is held\tAmâsu has told you that she believes Khûldim Umûn knows the location of the Dubarâkh, a hidden library archiving the history and culture of the Ambarûli people. She has asked you to talk to the prisoner in the cell on the west side of the lodge and see what you can learn.\n3\tTalk to Khûldim Umûn\tAmâsu has told you that she believes Khûldim Umûn knows the location of the Dubarâkh, a hidden library archiving the history and culture of the Ambarûli people. She has asked you to talk to the prisoner in the cell on the west side of the lodge and see what you can learn.\n4\tTalk to Girhâzi\tAmâsu has told you that she believes Khûldim Umûn knows the location of the Dubarâkh, a hidden library archiving the history and culture of the Ambarûli people. You have talked to the prisoner and should now return to Girhâzi.\n",
[12823]="7002F9A0\n1\tEntra en el campamento Nink-hai y localiza a su líder\tExplora el campamento Nink-hai por el sendero de montaña al este de Redilaldea. Langfrith te ha pedido que te infiltres en el campamento orco y derrotes al líder de la tribu.\n2\tUsa el cuerno para llamar la atención de Dargum y derrota a Grazadh\tEl líder de los Nink-hai se encuentra al final del paso de montaña, en las montañas. Langfrith te ha pedido que te infiltres en el campamento orco y derrotes al líder de la tribu.\n3\tRegresa con Langfrith e infórmale de la huida de Dargum\tLangfrith espera fuera del Salón del Hidromiel de Redilaldea. Langfrith querrá saber qué ocurrió cuando te enfrentaste al líder de los Nink-hai.\n",
[12824]="70015E4A\n1\tSalva a Anurandir\tLleva a Anurandir a un lugar seguro.\n2\tHabla con Dornhador\tRegresa a Dornhador en Echad Eregion. Informa a Dornhador que has rescatado a Anurandir.\n",
[12825]="700664DD\n1\tTalk to Dravron\tDervorin wants to know why lumber production is so slow. Talk to Dravron about why his camp is not putting out lumber.\n2\tTalk to Dervorin\tDravron mentioned that his leadership of the camp stems from a land claim passed down through his family. Report this finding to Dervorin in Ethring.\n",
[12826]="70052433\n1\tEdlothon te ha pedido que hables con los hobbits de Casa del Bosque para averiguar si la legendaria Anarlossë logró sobrevivir al declive del Reino del Norte.\t\n2\tHabla con Edlothon en el pueblo de Casa del Bosque\tEdlothon te ha acompañado al pueblo hobbit de Casa del Bosque, donde encontraste indicios de una flor que recuerda al legendario Anarlossë.\n3\tHabla con Marjoram Cosechalana en el pueblo de Casa del Bosque\tMarjoram Cosechalana desea hablar contigo y con Edlothon.\n4\tEncuentra los girasoles en el campo al norte de Casa del Bosque\tMarjoram Cosechalana te contó que flores del sol bordean un campo agrícola al norte de Casa del Bosque.\n5\tHabla con Edlothon en el campo cerca de Casa del Bosque\tEdlothon está junto a una hilera de girasoles en un campo no muy lejos del pueblo hobbit de Casa del Bosque.\n6\tHabla con Haerandel en el Recinto del Festival\tHaerandel está en el Recinto del Festival de las Tierras de Bree.\n",
[12827]="7002C619\n1\tEncuentra la cabaña del minero\tDeberías encontrar la cabaña del minero en la Garganta del Limclaro.\n2\tHabla con Brid\tDeberías hablar con el minero restante de la expedición.\n",
[12828]="7002EDF2\n1\tAsiste a Offram con Mantas para el invierno\030Asiste a Offram con Cuernos de batalla\030Asiste a Offram con haciendo las tartas de carne\tOffram está de guardia fuera del Salón del Vendedor en Eaworth. Offram te ha pedido que ayudes a aprovisionar la guarnición y la ciudad de Eaworth.\n2\tHabla con Offram fuera del Salón del Vendedor en Eaworth\tOffram está de guardia fuera del Salón del Vendedor en Eaworth. Debes regresar con Offram con noticias de tus éxitos.\n",
[12829]="70000079\n1\tUsa Moon\tLa bóveda está al otro lado de la Mansión de Thorin, al norte y subiendo las escaleras. Acciona las palancas de la bóveda en el orden correcto. Si cometes un error, vuelve con Bávor Piedraroja para reiniciar los engranajes. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n2\tUsa Axe\tLa bóveda está al otro lado de la Mansión de Thorin, al norte y subiendo las escaleras. Acciona las palancas de la bóveda en el orden correcto. Si cometes un error, vuelve con Bávor Piedraroja para reiniciar los engranajes. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n3\tUsa Sun\tLa bóveda está al otro lado de la Mansión de Thorin, al norte y subiendo las escaleras. Acciona las palancas de la bóveda en el orden correcto. Si cometes un error, vuelve con Bávor Piedraroja para reiniciar los engranajes. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n4\tUsa Jewel\tLa bóveda está al otro lado de la Mansión de Thorin, al norte y subiendo las escaleras. Acciona las palancas de la bóveda en el orden correcto. Si cometes un error, vuelve con Bávor Piedraroja para reiniciar los engranajes. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n5\tLleva el contenido de la bóveda enigma a Bávor Piedraroja\030Recoge el contenido de la bóveda enigma\tBávor Piedraroja está al otro lado de la Mansión de Thorin, hacia el sur. Ahora que has resuelto el acertijo de la bóveda enigma, deberías recoger el tesoro y llevarlo de vuelta con Bávor Piedraroja.\n",
[12830]="7000370B\n1\tHabla con Peg Pruner\tPeg Pruner está en el extremo norte de la plaza de Archet. El condestable Cardoso mencionó que Peg Pruner podría necesitar ayuda para reunir comida para los habitantes desplazados de Archet.\n",
[12831]="70044F27\n1\tMake your way through the Harlond with Aragorn\tMake your way through the Harlond with Aragorn's forces. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n2\tDefeat Kálmok and his squadron\tOpen the southern gate of the Rammas Echor so that Aragorn's men may make haste to the battle.\n3\tRegroup with Aragorn\tRegroup with Aragorn.\n4\tDefeat Orcs with Gimli and Halbarad\tDefeat Orcs with Gimli and Halbarad. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n5\tHelp Legolas, Elladan, and Elrohir defeat a Mûmak\tHelp Legolas, Elladan, and Elrohir defeat a Mûmak. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n6\tDerrota al Despojador Proscrito\tClear the Enemy off the of the blockaded bridge.\n",
[12832]="70044F26\n1\tMake your way through the Harlond with Aragorn\tMake your way through the Harlond with Aragorn's forces. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n2\tDefeat Kálmok and his squadron\tOpen the southern gate of the Rammas Echor so that Aragorn's men may make haste to the battle.\n3\tRegroup with Aragorn\tRegroup with Aragorn.\n4\tDefeat Orcs with Gimli and Halbarad\tDefeat Orcs with Gimli and Halbarad. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n5\tHelp Legolas, Elladan, and Elrohir defeat a Mûmak\tHelp Legolas, Elladan, and Elrohir defeat a Mûmak. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n6\tDerrota al Despojador Proscrito\tClear the Enemy off the of the blockaded bridge.\n",
